# Shell launchers must keep LF line endings so they run on macOS/Linux
# regardless of a contributor's core.autocrlf setting. Without this, a Windows
# checkout could store CRLF and break the shebang when run on a Mac (and break
# the `curl | bash` one-line installer served from GitHub raw).
*.sh        text eol=lf
*.command   text eol=lf

# The mirror pipeline embeds a bash script that runs on a Linux agent. A CRLF
# checkout committed from Windows would break it with `\r: command not found`.
*.yml       text eol=lf
